# remain archived.
#
# REVISION HISTORY
#   rev 1   (2026-10-15) original. ARCHIVED at
#                   docs/handoffs/entry-media-tests-rev1.sha256.
#   rev 2   (2026-10-15) corrections handoff. ARCHIVED at
#                   docs/handoffs/entry-media-tests-rev2-original.sha256.
#   rev 3   (2026-10-16) CR-01/02/03/04/05/08/09. ARCHIVED at
