#   rev 5   (2026-10-16) R1–R7. ARCHIVED at
#                   docs/handoffs/entry-media-tests-rev5-original.sha256.
#   rev 6   (2026-10-16) F1–F7 correction run for
#                   docs/reviews/entry-media-r1-r7-review.md. F1: the
#                   SignaturePadLib instance is created exactly once at
#                   mount; the local capture state no longer re-runs
#                   the mount effect and re-clears the pad. F2:
#                   rehydration decodes under a generation token;
#                   in-flight decodes are dropped on Clear, resize,
#                   summary change or unmount; Confirm is only
#                   enabled after a successful decode actually
#                   renders the image. F3: the unified review
#                   generation token covers both validation and
#                   preview; material edits bump the same counter.
#                   F6: the adopted probe type-checks under the
#                   repository's strict indexed-access settings without
#                   disabled rules. The probe now passes against a
#                   real Pointer Events stroke. F7 evidence is the
#                   matching manifest, the probe and the
#                   test-results/signature-probe-* artifacts.
#
# Historical baselines remain archived and are not regenerated.
